"""Видео: videos in large cards, played full screen by b8k-vplay.

Three pages under the search field: Подписки (the newest videos of the
channels one follows, all together), Каналы (those channels with their
avatar, subscribers and latest video; a tap shows one, the cross
unfollows; a field above them finds new channels) and История (what was
played). A search shows its
results in place of the page. A tap on a card plays the video; a long press
follows or unfollows its channel.

Where the videos come from is a set of sources (the sources package next to
this file, or /usr/local/lib/b8k-video/sources): YouTube and VK Видео now,
others the same way. A button by the search field chooses where searches
go; followed channels and the history hold videos of every source. Followed channels are kept in ~/.config/b8k/video.json, the
history in ~/.local/share/b8k-video/history.json, card pictures in
~/.cache/b8k-video/.
"""
